  "notes": "{広|ひろ}める is an ichidan verb meaning to spread, disseminate, or broaden.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{広|ひろ}まる→広まる：02404_hiromaru⟧ (intransitive: to spread, become widespread)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{知識|ちしき}→知識：01463_chishiki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{広|ひろ}める: to spread knowledge\n- ⟦{名|な}→名：03496_na⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{広|ひろ}める: to make one's name known\n- ⟦{教|おし}え→教え：01909_oshie⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{広|ひろ}める: to spread teachings\n- ⟦{視野|しや}→視野：08659_shiya⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{広|ひろ}める: to broaden one's horizons\n- ⟦{見聞|けんぶん}→見聞：20127_kenbun⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{広|ひろ}める: to broaden one's experience\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used for spreading ideas, knowledge, or influence. For physical spreading (like spreading a map), ⟦{広|ひろ}げる→広げる：01981_hirogeru⟧ is more common.",
